{"id":"46e87ff789f642ef720a1664d656ec84d8036437","axis":"silent","repo":"strapi/strapi","sha":"46e87ff789f642ef720a1664d656ec84d8036437","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/tests.yml","lines":["@@ -1036,8 +1036,9 @@ jobs:","       fail-fast: false","       matrix:","         # Labels only for now: the run step doesn't read them yet and always runs Chromium CE.","-        # The EE replay of @ee and @smoke tests comes with the edition contract (CMS-1944), and","-        # WebKit with the browser projects (CMS-1949); both need the run step to pass them on.","+        # The suites read STRAPI_TEST_EDITION (default ce, CMS-1944); the EE replay of the @ee","+        # and @smoke tests (an `ee` entry with the license secret) comes with CMS-2242, and","+        # WebKit with the browser projects (CMS-1949).","         edition: [ce]","         project: [chromium]","     steps:"],"additions":3,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests-next/README.md","lines":["@@ -3,12 +3,12 @@"," The new test suites of the Test Infrastructure Overhaul. They replace `/tests` domain by domain,"," and the folder is renamed `/tests` at the cutover."," ","-| Workspace | Package                | Runner                                                       |","-| --------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |","-| `shared/` | `@strapi/tests-shared` | Foundation: app generation and server lifecycle, test plugin |","-| `ui/`     | `@strapi/tests-e2e`    | Playwright, `*.ui-test.ts`                                   |","-| `api/`    | `@strapi/tests-api`    | Vitest, `*.api-test.ts`                                      |","-| `cli/`    | `@strapi/tests-cli`    | Vitest, `*.cli-test.ts`                                      |","+| Workspace | Package                | Runner                                                                  |","+| --------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |","+| `shared/` | `@strapi/tests-shared` | Foundation: app lifecycle, scaffolders, seeders, DB resets, test plugin |","+| `ui/`     | `@strapi/tests-e2e`    | Playwright, `*.ui-test.ts`                                              |","+| `api/`    | `@strapi/tests-api`    | Vitest, `*.api-test.ts`                                                 |","+| `cli/`    | `@strapi/tests-cli`    | Vitest, `*.cli-test.ts`                                                 |"," "," ## Run"," ","@@ -40,5 +40,63 @@ yarn nx run @strapi/tests-e2e:test      # also builds the admin of its app, abou","   reset runs before the file's `beforeAll`, and never before its `afterAll`, which sees what the","   tests wrote. The restore needs the snapshot's schema: specs that change the schema","   (Content-Type Builder) aren't supported yet, and will come with the first such spec.","+- **Edition** (RFC D6): `STRAPI_TEST_EDITION=ce` (default) or `ee`, read by one module","+  (`shared/src/edition`) for every suite. `ee` needs `STRAPI_LICENSE`; without it, or when","+  Strapi rejects the license and boots as CE, the run fails instead of testing CE. A CE run","+  removes any license from the app env. See [Edition](#edition)."," - **One ui worker** for now: each worker will need its own app and database first."," - **Windows** is not supported yet: stopping a server signals its process group.","+","+## Set up an app","+","+Write the schema and config before boot, seed, then boot once. No step restarts Strapi.","+","+```ts","+const app = await generateApp({ name: `api-articles-${worker}` });","+await resetDatabase(app, database);","+","+// Scaffolders: files in the app, synced by Strapi on boot.","+scaffoldContentType(app, {","+  singularName: 'article',","+  draftAndPublish: true,","+  attributes: { title: { type: 'string' } },","+});","+scaffoldComponent(app, { uid: 'shared.seo', attributes: { title: { type: 'string' } } });","+scaffoldConfig(app, 'features', { future: { experimental_firstPublishedAt: true } }); // read at boot","+scaffoldPlugin(app, 'users-permissions', { config: { jwt: { expiresIn: '1h' } } });","+","+// Seeders, before boot: one Strapi load for the whole plan (about 2.5 s).","+const { apiTokens } = await seedApp(","+  app,","+  {","+    adminUsers: [{ email, password, firstname, lastname, roles: ['strapi-editor'] }],","+    entries: [{ uid: 'api::article.article', data: { title: 'Hello' }, status: 'published' }],","+    apiTokens: [{ name: 'full', type: 'full-access' }],","+  },","+  { database }","+);","+","+const server = await startServer(app, { port, database });","+","+// Seeders, in the running server: data a test adds on top, without a restart.","+await seed(server, { entries: [{ uid: 'api::article.article', data: { title: 'Live' } }] });","+```","+","+A seed plan (`SeedPlan`) is JSON: locales, admin roles and users, end users, media, entries and","+API tokens (content API and admin). The test plugin runs it in that order, so `seedApp` and","+`seed` behave the same. Examples: `api/tests/seed/` and `api/tests/scenarios/settings-spike`.","+","+## Edition","+","+Features and future flags are read from the running instance (`getInstanceFeatures(server)`),","+never from env vars. A test that needs one the instance doesn't have **fails**, it doesn't skip.","+","+- **ui (Playwright):** tag EE-only tests `@ee`; CE runs leave them out. EE runs replay the","+  `@ee` and `@smoke` tests only. Declare requirements with","+  `test.use({ requires: { ee: ['cms-content-releases'], future: ['someFlag'] } })`, and read","+  the instance with the `features` fixture.","+- **api and cli (Vitest):** `describeEE()` and `describeIfFeature()` from","+  `@strapi/tests-shared/vitest` run only in EE runs, and `describeIfFeature()` fails when the","+  feature is missing. `requireFeatures(features, { future: [...] })` checks future flags.","+","+Set future flags with `scaffoldConfig(app, 'features', { future: { someFlag: true } })`."],"additions":64,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests-next/api/tests/edition/edition.api-test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,161 @@","+import { afterAll, beforeAll, describe, expect, test, vi } from 'vitest';","+","+import {","+  EDITION_ENV_VAR,","+  SQLITE,","+  appEnv,","+  databaseFromEnv,","+  editionEnv,","+  editionFromEnv,","+  generateApp,","+  getInstanceFeatures,","+  resetDatabase,","+  requireFeatures,","+  scaffoldConfig,","+  startServer,","+  stopAllServers,","+  type App,","+  type Server,","+} from '@strapi/tests-shared';","+import { describeEE, describeIfFeature, requireServerFeature } from '@strapi/tests-shared/vitest';","+","+import { port, worker } from '../helpers';","+","+/** The edition contract (RFC D6). The suite runs in the edition of STRAPI_TEST_EDITION. */","+","+describe('editionFromEnv', () => {","+  test('defaults to CE', () => {","+    expect(editionFromEnv({})).toBe('ce');","+  });","+","+  test('EE without a license is a hard failure, not a CE fallback', () => {","+    expect(() => editionFromEnv({ [EDITION_ENV_VAR]: 'ee' })).toThrow('needs a STRAPI_LICENSE');","+    expect(editionFromEnv({ [EDITION_ENV_VAR]: 'ee', STRAPI_LICENSE: 'key' })).toBe('ee');","+  });","+","+  test('rejects an unknown edition', () => {","+    expect(() => editionFromEnv({ [EDITION_ENV_VAR]: 'enterprise' })).toThrow(","+      'must be \"ce\" or \"ee\"'","+    );","+  });","+});","+","+describe('editionEnv', () => {","+  test('CE turns EE off and drops a license from the shell', () => {","+    expect(editionEnv('ce', { STRAPI_LICENSE: 'key' })).toEqual({","+      STRAPI_DISABLE_EE: 'true',","+      STRAPI_LICENSE: '',","+    });","+  });","+","+  test('EE passes the license on', () => {","+    expect(editionEnv('ee', { STRAPI_LICENSE: 'key' })).toEqual({","+      STRAPI_DISABLE_EE: 'false',","+      STRAPI_LICENSE: 'key',","+    });","+  });","+","+  test('sees a license passed in the env of the app, not only the shell one', () => {","+    vi.stubEnv('STRAPI_LICENSE', '');","+    try {","+      const app = { name: 'unused', dir: '/unused', dbFile: '/unused/data.db' };","+      const env = appEnv(app, {","+        database: SQLITE,","+        edition: 'ee',","+        testPlugin: true,","+        fakeAiProvider: false,","+        env: { STRAPI_LICENSE: 'passed-in-env' },","+      });","+      expect(env).toMatchObject({ STRAPI_DISABLE_EE: 'false', STRAPI_LICENSE: 'passed-in-env' });","+    } finally {","+      vi.unstubAllEnvs();","+    }","+  });","+});","+","+describe('the instance', () => {","+  let app: App;","+  let server: Server;","+","+  beforeAll(async () => {","+    app = await generateApp({ name: `api-edition-${worker}` });","+    scaffoldConfig(app, 'features', { future: { testsFlag: true, testsFlagOff: false } });","+    await resetDatabase(app, databaseFromEnv());","+    server = await startServer(app, { port });","+  });","+","+  afterAll(async () => {","+    await stopAllServers();","+  });","+","+  test('runs in the edition of the run, read from the instance', async () => {","+    const features = await getInstanceFeatures(server);","+    expect(features.edition).toBe(editionFromEnv());","+    expect(server.edition).toBe(editionFromEnv());","+    if (features.edition === 'ce') {","+      expect(features.ee).toEqual([]);","+    }","+  });","+","+  test('reports the future flags that are on', async () => {","+    const features = await getInstanceFeatures(server);","+    expect(features.future).toContain('testsFlag');","+    // Strapi's isEnabled says off for a flag set to false.","+    expect(features.future).not.toContain('testsFlagOff');","+    expect(() => requireFeatures(features, { future: ['testsFlag'] })).not.toThrow();","+  });","+","+  test('a missing feature or flag fails instead of skipping', async () => {","+    const features = await getInstanceFeatures(server);","+    expect(() => requireFeatures(features, { future: ['nope'] })).toThrow(","+      'needs future flag \"nope\"'","+    );","+    expect(() => requireFeatures(features, { ee: ['nope'] })).toThrow('needs EE feature \"nope\"');","+  });","+","+  test(\"describeIfFeature's check fails on a feature the instance doesn't have\", async () => {","+    await expect(requireServerFeature(server, 'tests-not-a-feature')).rejects.toThrow(","+      'needs EE feature \"tests-not-a-feature\"'","+    );","+    await expect(requireServerFeature(server, 'tests-not-a-feature')).rejects.toThrow(","+      `the ${server.edition.toUpperCase()} instance doesn't have`","+    );","+  });","+","+  test(\"describeIfFeature's check fails clearly when the server is not started yet\", async () => {","+    await expect(requireServerFeature(undefined, 'cms-content-releases')).rejects.toThrow(","+      'in an outer beforeAll'","+    );","+  });","+","+  describeEE('EE-only block', () => {","+    test('runs only in EE runs', () => {","+      expect(editionFromEnv()).toBe('ee');","+    });","+  });","+","+  describeIfFeature(","+    'cms-content-releases',","+    () => server,","+    'feature-gated block',","+    () => {","+      test('runs only in EE runs, on an instance with the feature', () => {","+        expect(editionFromEnv()).toBe('ee');","+      });","+    }","+  );","+});","+","+describe('the license', () => {","+  afterAll(async () => {","+    await stopAllServers();","+  });","+","+  test('an EE run whose license Strapi rejects fails instead of running as CE', async () => {","+    const app = await generateApp({ name: `api-edition-${worker}`, overwrite: false });","+    await resetDatabase(app, databaseFromEnv());","+    await expect(","+      startServer(app, { port, edition: 'ee', env: { STRAPI_LICENSE: 'not-a-license' } })","+    ).rejects.toThrow('Strapi booted as CE in an EE run');","+  });","+});"],"additions":161,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests-next/api/tests/helpers.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@","+import { appPort, type Server } from '@strapi/tests-shared';","+","+/** Vitest worker of this file (1-based), for app names and ports that don't collide. */","+export const worker = Number(process.env.VITEST_POOL_ID ?? 1);","+","+export const port = appPort('api', worker - 1);","+","+export interface Response {","+  status: number;","+  // The tests read the bodies they expect: typing every route is not worth it here.","+  // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any","+  body: any;","+}","+","+/** A JSON request to a test server. */","+export const request = async (","+  server: Server,","+  path: string,","+  { method = 'GET', token, body }: { method?: string; token?: string; body?: unknown } = {}","+): Promise<Response> => {","+  const res = await fetch(`${server.url}${path}`, {","+    method,","+    headers: {","+      ...(token ? { authorization: `Bearer ${token}` } : {}),","+      ...(body === undefined ? {} : { 'content-type': 'application/json' }),","+    },","+    body: body === undefined ? undefined : JSON.stringify(body),","+  });","+  const text = await res.text();","+  let parsed: unknown = text;","+  try {","+    parsed = text ? JSON.parse(text) : null;","+  } catch {","+    // not JSON: keep the text","+  }","+  return { status: res.status, body: parsed };","+};","+","+/** Log an admin user in through the API. Returns the access token. */","+export const adminLogin = async (server: Server, email: string, password: string) => {","+  const res = await request(server, '/admin/login', { method: 'POST', body: { email, password } });","+  if (res.status !== 200) {","+    throw new Error(`Admin login of ${email} failed: ${res.status} ${JSON.stringify(res.body)}`);","+  }","+  return res.body.data.token as string;","+};"],"additions":46,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests-next/api/tests/scaffold/scaffolders.api-test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,165 @@","+import fs from 'node:fs';","+import os from 'node:os';","+import path from 'node:path';","+","+import { afterAll, beforeAll, describe, expect, test } from 'vitest';","+","+import {","+  databaseFromEnv,","+  generateApp,","+  readScaffoldedConfig,","+  resetDatabase,","+  scaffoldComponent,","+  scaffoldConfig,","+  scaffoldContentType,","+  scaffoldPlugin,","+  seed,","+  startServer,","+  stopAllServers,","+  type App,","+  type Server,","+} from '@strapi/tests-shared';","+","+import { port, request, worker } from '../helpers';","+","+const database = databaseFromEnv();","+","+let app: App;","+let server: Server;","+let token: string;","+","+beforeAll(async () => {","+  app = await generateApp({ name: `api-scaffold-${worker}` });","+  await resetDatabase(app, database);","+","+  // Everything is written before the one boot of this file.","+  scaffoldComponent(app, {","+    uid: 'shared.address',","+    attributes: { street: { type: 'string' }, city: { type: 'string' } },","+  });","+  scaffoldContentType(app, {","+    singularName: 'restaurant',","+    attributes: {","+      name: { type: 'string', required: true },","+      address: { type: 'component', component: 'shared.address', repeatable: false },","+    },","+  });","+  scaffoldContentType(app, {","+    singularName: 'homepage',","+    pluralName: 'homepages',","+    kind: 'singleType',","+    draftAndPublish: true,","+    attributes: { title: { type: 'string' } },","+  });","+  scaffoldConfig(app, 'api', { rest: { defaultLimit: 2 } });","+  scaffoldConfig(app, 'api', { rest: { maxLimit: 50 } });","+  // Read at boot: draft and publish types get a `firstPublishedAt` attribute.","+  scaffoldConfig(app, 'features', { future: { experimental_firstPublishedAt: true } });","+  // The app's .env has four keys: the scaffolded array replaces them, it doesn't merge with them.","+  scaffoldConfig(app, 'server', { app: { keys: ['only-key'] } });","+  scaffoldPlugin(app, 'users-permissions', { config: { jwt: { expiresIn: '1h' } } });","+","+  server = await startServer(app, { port, database });","+","+  const { apiTokens } = await seed(server, { apiTokens: [{ name: 'full', type: 'full-access' }] });","+  token = apiTokens[0].accessKey;","+});","+","+afterAll(async () => {","+  await stopAllServers();","+});","+","+describe('scaffoldContentType and scaffoldComponent', () => {","+  test('a collection type with a component gets its Content API routes', async () => {","+    await seed(server, {","+      entries: ['Chez Paul', 'Le Bistrot', 'La Cantine'].map((name) => ({","+        uid: 'api::restaurant.restaurant',","+        data: { name, address: { street: '1 rue de Paris', city: 'Paris' } },","+      })),","+    });","+","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/restaurants?populate=address&sort=name', { token });","+","+    expect(res.status).toBe(200);","+    expect(res.body.data).toHaveLength(2); // api.rest.defaultLimit, scaffolded below","+    expect(res.body.meta.pagination.total).toBe(3);","+    expect(res.body.data[0]).toMatchObject({","+      name: 'Chez Paul',","+      address: { street: '1 rue de Paris', city: 'Paris' },","+    });","+  });","+","+  test('a single type with draft and publish', async () => {","+    const draft = await request(server, '/api/homepage?status=draft', {","+      method: 'PUT',","+      token,","+      body: { data: { title: 'Draft' } },","+    });","+    expect(draft.status).toBe(200);","+","+    // Without draft and publish, Strapi ignores `status` and this would return the entry.","+    const unpublished = await request(server, '/api/homepage', { token });","+    expect(unpublished.status).toBe(404);","+    const drafts = await request(server, '/api/homepage?status=draft', { token });","+    expect(drafts.body.data).toMatchObject({ title: 'Draft' });","+","+    const put = await request(server, '/api/homepage?status=published', {","+      method: 'PUT',","+      token,","+      body: { data: { title: 'Welcome' } },","+    });","+    expect(put.status).toBe(200);","+","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/homepage', { token });","+    expect(res.body.data).toMatchObject({ title: 'Welcome' });","+  });","+","+  test('rejects names Strapi would not load', () => {","+    expect(() => scaffoldContentType(app, { singularName: 'BadName', attributes: {} })).toThrow(","+      'kebab-case'","+    );","+    expect(() => scaffoldComponent(app, { uid: 'address', attributes: {} })).toThrow(","+      '<category>.<name>'","+    );","+  });","+});","+","+describe('scaffoldConfig and scaffoldPlugin', () => {","+  test('calls on the same file merge', async () => {","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/tests/config?path=api.rest');","+    expect(res.body.value).toMatchObject({ defaultLimit: 2, maxLimit: 50 });","+  });","+","+  test('boot-time config, such as a future flag, applies', async () => {","+    // experimental_firstPublishedAt adds the attribute when Strapi loads the content types.","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/homepage?status=published', {","+      method: 'PUT',","+      token,","+      body: { data: { title: 'First published' } },","+    });","+    expect(res.status).toBe(200);","+    expect(res.body.data.firstPublishedAt).toEqual(expect.any(String));","+  });","+","+  test('arrays replace the app config in the config Strapi loads', async () => {","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/tests/config?path=server.app.keys');","+    expect(res.body.value).toEqual(['only-key']);","+  });","+","+  test('plugin config applies', async () => {","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/tests/config?path=plugin::users-permissions.jwt');","+    expect(res.body.value).toMatchObject({ expiresIn: '1h' });","+  });","+","+  test('calls on the same file replace arrays', () => {","+    // Not in the app: `strapi develop` restarts when a config file changes.","+    const offline: App = { ...app, dir: fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'scaffold-')) };","+    scaffoldConfig(offline, 'custom', { list: [1, 2, 3], nested: { a: 1 } });","+    scaffoldConfig(offline, 'custom', { list: [4], nested: { b: 2 } });","+","+    expect(readScaffoldedConfig(offline, 'custom')).toEqual({","+      list: [4],","+      nested: { a: 1, b: 2 },","+    });","+  });","+});"],"additions":165,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests-next/api/tests/scenarios/settings-spike.api-test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,184 @@","+import { afterAll, beforeAll, describe, expect, test } from 'vitest';","+","+import {","+  databaseFromEnv,","+  generateApp,","+  resetDatabase,","+  restoreDatabase,","+  scaffoldContentType,","+  seedApp,","+  snapshotDatabase,","+  startServer,","+  stopAllServers,","+  type Server,","+} from '@strapi/tests-shared';","+","+import { adminLogin, port, request, worker } from '../helpers';","+","+/**","+ * The scenario of the data lifecycle spike (CMS-1943, `settings` domain), on the scaffolders and","+ * seeders: a content type written before boot, one admin per default role and two entries seeded","+ * before boot, one boot, the role logins, then a snapshot. A test changes state Strapi may hold in","+ * memory (roles and permissions, the default locale, users, entries); a restore must undo all of","+ * it and keep every session valid.","+ */","+","+const database = databaseFromEnv();","+","+const PASSWORD = 'Testing123!';","+const ARTICLE = 'api::article.article';","+const ROLES = {","+  admin: { email: 'admin@test.io', role: 'strapi-super-admin' },","+  editor: { email: 'editor@test.io', role: 'strapi-editor' },","+  author: { email: 'author@test.io', role: 'strapi-author' },","+};","+","+let server: Server;","+const tokens: Record<keyof typeof ROLES, string> = { admin: '', editor: '', author: '' };","+","+const roleByCode = async (code: string) => {","+  const res = await request(server, '/admin/roles', { token: tokens.admin });","+  return res.body.data.find((role: { code: string }) => role.code === code);","+};","+","+const editorCanListArticles = async () =>","+  (","+    await request(server, `/content-manager/collection-types/${ARTICLE}`, {","+      token: tokens.editor,","+    })","+  ).status === 200;","+","+const defaultLocale = async () => {","+  const res = await request(server, '/i18n/locales', { token: tokens.admin });","+  return res.body.find((locale: { isDefault: boolean }) => locale.isDefault)?.code;","+};","+","+const expectSeededState = async () => {","+  const roles = await request(server, '/admin/roles', { token: tokens.admin });","+  expect(roles.body.data.map((role: { code: string }) => role.code).sort()).toEqual([","+    'strapi-author',","+    'strapi-editor',","+    'strapi-super-admin',","+  ]);","+","+  expect(await editorCanListArticles()).toBe(true);","+","+  expect(await defaultLocale()).toBe('en');","+","+  const users = await request(server, '/admin/users', { token: tokens.admin });","+  expect(users.body.data.pagination.total).toBe(3);","+","+  const articles = await request(server, `/content-manager/collection-types/${ARTICLE}`, {","+    token: tokens.admin,","+  });","+  expect(articles.body.pagination.total).toBe(2);","+","+  // Every role's session survived.","+  for (const token of Object.values(tokens)) {","+    expect((await request(server, '/admin/users/me', { token })).status).toBe(200);","+  }","+};","+","+const expectCreated = (res: { status: number; body: unknown }) => {","+  expect([200, 201], JSON.stringify(res.body)).toContain(res.status);","+};","+","+const changeEverything = async () => {","+  const author = await roleByCode('strapi-author');","+  const editor = await roleByCode('strapi-editor');","+","+  expect(","+    (","+      await request(server, '/admin/roles', {","+        method: 'POST',","+        token: tokens.admin,","+        body: { name: 'Spike role', description: 'Created by a test' },","+      })","+    ).status","+  ).toBe(201);","+","+  await request(server, `/admin/roles/${editor.id}/permissions`, {","+    method: 'PUT',","+    token: tokens.admin,","+    body: { permissions: [] },","+  });","+  expect(await editorCanListArticles()).toBe(false);","+","+  expectCreated(","+    await request(server, '/i18n/locales', {","+      method: 'POST',","+      token: tokens.admin,","+      body: { code: 'de', name: 'German (de)', isDefault: true },","+    })","+  );","+  expect(await defaultLocale()).toBe('de');","+","+  expectCreated(","+    await request(server, '/admin/users', {","+      method: 'POST',","+      token: tokens.admin,","+      body: { email: 'new@test.io', firstname: 'New', lastname: 'User', roles: [author.id] },","+    })","+  );","+","+  expectCreated(","+    await request(server, `/content-manager/collection-types/${ARTICLE}`, {","+      method: 'POST',","+      token: tokens.admin,","+      body: { title: 'Written by a test' },","+    })","+  );","+};","+","+beforeAll(async () => {","+  const app = await generateApp({ name: `api-spike-${worker}` });","+  await resetDatabase(app, database);","+","+  scaffoldContentType(app, { singularName: 'article', attributes: { title: { type: 'string' } } });","+","+  await seedApp(","+    app,","+    {","+      adminUsers: Object.entries(ROLES).map(([name, { email, role }]) => ({","+        email,","+        password: PASSWORD,","+        firstname: name,","+        lastname: 'User',","+        roles: [role],","+      })),","+      entries: ['Why I prefer football over soccer', 'Spike article'].map((title) => ({","+        uid: ARTICLE,","+        data: { title },","+      })),","+    },","+    { database }","+  );","+","+  server = await startServer(app, { port, database });","+","+  for (const [name, { email }] of Object.entries(ROLES)) {","+    tokens[name as keyof typeof ROLES] = await adminLogin(server, email, PASSWORD);","+  }","+  // After the logins: their sessions are rows of the snapshot.","+  if (database.client === 'sqlite') {","+    await snapshotDatabase(server);","+  }","+});","+","+afterAll(async () => {","+  await stopAllServers();","+});","+","+test('the seeded state', async () => {","+  await expectSeededState();","+});","+","+describe.skipIf(database.client !== 'sqlite')('restore', () => {","+  test('a restore undoes every change and keeps the sessions', async () => {","+    await changeEverything();","+","+    await restoreDatabase(server);","+","+    await expectSeededState();","+  });","+});"],"additions":184,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests-next/api/tests/seed/seeders.api-test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,265 @@","+import fs from 'node:fs';","+import os from 'node:os';","+import path from 'node:path';","+","+import { afterAll, beforeAll, describe, expect, test, vi } from 'vitest';","+","+import {","+  databaseFromEnv,","+  generateApp,","+  resetDatabase,","+  scaffoldContentType,","+  seed,","+  seedApp,","+  startServer,","+  stopAllServers,","+  type App,","+  type SeedResult,","+  type Server,","+} from '@strapi/tests-shared';","+","+import { adminLogin, port, request, worker } from '../helpers';","+","+const database = databaseFromEnv();","+","+const PASSWORD = 'Testing123!';","+const ARTICLE = 'api::article.article';","+// With i18n, a Content Manager permission without `locales` grants no locale at all.","+const READ_ARTICLES = {","+  action: 'plugin::content-manager.explorer.read',","+  subject: ARTICLE,","+  properties: { fields: ['title'], locales: ['en', 'fr'] },","+};","+// A 1x1 transparent PNG.","+const PNG = Buffer.from(","+  'iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==',","+  'base64'","+);","+","+let app: App;","+let server: Server;","+let seeded: SeedResult;","+let fullAccess: string;","+// Shell values the test apps must not see (README, Database), set while seedApp runs.","+const SHELL_ENV = {","+  STRAPI_TEST_AI_PROVIDER: 'fake',","+  DATABASE_URL: 'postgres://127.0.0.1:1/elsewhere',","+};","+let shellEnvDuringSeed: Record<string, string | undefined> = {};","+","+beforeAll(async () => {","+  app = await generateApp({ name: `api-seed-${worker}` });","+  await resetDatabase(app, database);","+","+  scaffoldContentType(app, {","+    singularName: 'article',","+    draftAndPublish: true,","+    pluginOptions: { i18n: { localized: true } },","+    attributes: {","+      title: { type: 'string', pluginOptions: { i18n: { localized: true } } },","+    },","+  });","+","+  const image = path.join(fs.mkdtempSync(path.join(os.tmpdir(), 'seed-media-')), 'pixel.png');","+  fs.writeFileSync(image, PNG);","+","+  // Before boot, in one Strapi load. With the shell values above reaching the seed process,","+  // CE refuses the fake AI provider and a database server run connects to DATABASE_URL.","+  for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(SHELL_ENV)) {","+    vi.stubEnv(key, value);","+  }","+  shellEnvDuringSeed = {","+    STRAPI_TEST_AI_PROVIDER: process.env.STRAPI_TEST_AI_PROVIDER,","+    DATABASE_URL: process.env.DATABASE_URL,","+  };","+  try {","+    // No { database }: seedApp seeds the run's database by default, like startServer.","+    seeded = await seedApp(app, {","+      locales: [{ code: 'fr', name: 'French (fr)' }],","+      adminRoles: [","+        { name: 'Article reader', code: 'article-reader', permissions: [READ_ARTICLES] },","+      ],","+      adminUsers: [","+        {","+          email: 'admin@test.io',","+          password: PASSWORD,","+          firstname: 'Super',","+          lastname: 'Admin',","+          roles: ['strapi-super-admin'],","+        },","+        {","+          email: 'reader@test.io',","+          password: PASSWORD,","+          firstname: 'Article',","+          lastname: 'Reader',","+          roles: ['article-reader'],","+        },","+      ],","+      users: [{ username: 'jane', email: 'jane@test.io', password: PASSWORD }],","+      media: [{ file: image, alternativeText: 'A pixel' }],","+      entries: [","+        { uid: ARTICLE, data: { title: 'Hello' }, status: 'published' },","+        { uid: ARTICLE, data: { title: 'Bonjour' }, locale: 'fr', status: 'published' },","+      ],","+      apiTokens: [","+        { name: 'full', type: 'full-access' },","+        { kind: 'admin', name: 'reader', owner: 'admin@test.io', permissions: [READ_ARTICLES] },","+        {","+          kind: 'admin',","+          name: 'owned by the reader',","+          owner: 'reader@test.io',","+          permissions: [READ_ARTICLES],","+        },","+      ],","+    });","+  } finally {","+    vi.unstubAllEnvs();","+  }","+  fullAccess = seeded.apiTokens[0].accessKey;","+","+  server = await startServer(app, { port, database });","+});","+","+afterAll(async () => {","+  await stopAllServers();","+});","+","+describe('seedApp, before boot', () => {","+  test('returns what it created', () => {","+    expect(seeded.locales).toEqual([expect.objectContaining({ code: 'fr' })]);","+    expect(seeded.adminRoles).toEqual([expect.objectContaining({ code: 'article-reader' })]);","+    expect(seeded.adminUsers.map((user) => user.email)).toEqual([","+      'admin@test.io',","+      'reader@test.io',","+    ]);","+    expect(seeded.entries).toHaveLength(2);","+    expect(seeded.entries[0].documentId).toEqual(expect.any(String));","+    expect(seeded.apiTokens.map((token) => token.accessKey)).toEqual([","+      expect.any(String),","+      expect.any(String),","+      expect.any(String),","+    ]);","+  });","+","+  test('locales', async () => {","+    const res = await request(server, '/api/i18n/locales', { token: fullAccess });","+    expect(res.body.map((locale: { code: string }) => locale.code).sort()).toEqual(['en', 'fr']);","+  });","+","+  test('admin roles with their permissions, and admin users', async () => {","+    const reader = await adminLogin(server, 'reader@test.io', PASSWORD);","+","+    const articles = await request(server, `/content-manager/collection-types/${ARTICLE}`, {","+      token: reader,","+    });","+    expect(articles.status).toBe(200);","+    expect(articles.body.results).toEqual([expect.objectContaining({ title: 'Hello' })]);"],"additions":156,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":779,"deletions":8,"truncated":true,"file_count":7},"error":null,"fetched_at":"20